# Cargo.lock is intentionally NOT ignored. Generate, review, and commit it.
# Self-contained Cargo registry for tools/verdict-upload (ic-agent is not in the
# default cache); a cache, not a source.
.cargohome/
# The tiny fixture pack is committed (108 KB total) so a fresh clone can validate it:
# `tools/make_verdict_fixture.py --check` re-reads these bytes, and `tools/verify.py`
# runs that check. Generation is still available for changes (`--write` side).
# Scratch: the `ax` fetch cache and the downloaded upstream source used to read the
# reference implementation. Neither is project source.
/.cache/
/.axtmp/
